{"version":1,"content":"<p>40歲日本女星澤尻英龍華，2019年爆出毒案被電視台封殺，即使2024年主演舞台劇復出後，仍然絕跡公仔箱。</p><p>不過，近年她積極洗底，演藝事業亦逐漸重回正軌。</p><p>她被爆相隔7年終於解禁，有份參演明年1月播出的新劇。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T13:24:02.738298+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:03:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:23.133417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:23.133417+00:00","content_hash":"d0b682b42dd338f0fbaabe7c32b3da63da1292f3078008f8230206cd6e8ce5c1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}